ter-group-table.md","line":96},{"title":"Search Source form","target":"search-source-form-ais","line":110},{"title":"Search Application Configurations","target":"defining-search-app-cfgs-ais","line":121},{"title":"AI Search","target":"ia-ai-search","line":184},{"title":"Default global search sources for Next Experience UI","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.md","line":270},{"title":"Add a search source for Next Experience UI","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.md","line":280},{"title":"Configure a table for indexing and searching","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/configure-single-table-for-indexing.md","line":282},{"title":"Default global text search groups for Core UI","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.md","line":290},{"title":"the **glide.ui.no\\_text\\_search** system property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/search-administration/set-global-text-search-properties.md","line":340},{"title":"Results","target":"hs-results","line":387},{"title":"Search Source form","target":"search-source-form-ais","line":388},{"title":"Search application configurations","target":"defining-search-app-cfgs-ais","line":389},{"title":"AI Search","target":"ia-ai-search","line":390}],"metadata":{"title":"Search settings filter and group global search results by table","description":"Global search filters and groups matching results by table. You can configure search sources \\(in Next Experience UI\\) or search groups to define tables and groups for global search.Global search in Next Experience UI displays search results broken out by search source. A search source is a collection of global search settings for a ServiceNow AI Platform table.The base system includes these default search sources for global search in Next Experience UI.Add a new search source to make a table searchable by global search or workspace search in Next Experience UI.Global text search in Core UI displays search results broken out by search group. A search group is a collection of related searchable tables.The base system includes these default text search groups for global text search in Core UI.Add a new text search group to filter global text search results by table in Core UI.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.html","release":"australia","product":"Search Administration","classification":"search-administration","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":10,"breadcrumb":["Global search finds records from multiple tables","Zing text indexing and search engine","Search administration","Configure core features","Administer the ServiceNow AI Platform"],"tags":["#platform-administration","#search","#index","#administration","#solr","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1mf1ydb","at":1784561347995},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/search-administration/search-settings-filter-group-table.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":1576,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
